{{- /*
  Generates one programme page per record in data/programmes/, at
  /programmes/<slug>/.

  A programme therefore becomes a page as soon as its record is written: there
  is no second file to add and no page to keep in step. The page itself is
  rendered by layouts/programmes/single.html.

  The path is the record's slug, so the URL is derived from the canonical
  identifier rather than restated anywhere. That is the same rule the
  programme validator enforces on the record itself: the file name, the slug
  field and every reference all have to agree, and this adds no third place for
  them to disagree in.

  Nothing is generated while the catalogue is empty, so an empty registry
  produces no programme pages and no programme links. The section's own index
  is a separate, hand-written file and is not generated from here.

  The courses inside a programme are not listed here. They are found by
  layouts/programmes/single.html from the courses' own `programme` front matter,
  so membership is written once, on the course.

  Generated pages are indexed like any other page. The `sitemap.disable` key that
  once sat on this AddPage call, and the matching one in
  content/programmes/_index.md, have both been removed now that the catalogue is
  promoted and linked from the site navigation.
*/ -}}
{{- range $slug, $programme := hugo.Data.programmes -}}
    {{- $.AddPage (dict
        "path" $slug
        "title" $programme.title
        "kind" "page"
        "params" (merge $programme (dict "slug" $slug))
        "content" (dict "mediaType" "text/markdown" "value" "")) -}}
{{- end -}}
